# Solemnity's "Counters can't be put on ... lands" stops the counters a land would enter with (CR 122.6, 101.2, the ruling): Dark
# Depths, played with Solemnity on the battlefield, enters with none of its ten ice counters. "When Dark Depths has no ice counters
# on it" is a state trigger (CR 603.8): it triggers at once, Dark Depths is sacrificed, and Bot1 creates Marit Lage, a legendary
# 20/20 black Avatar token with flying and indestructible.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Solemnity
Dark Depths
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

